      en: ["The reserve spans a total area of approximately 5,500 square kilometers.", "It is located in the western part of Western Bahr el Ghazal State.", "The park was primarily founded to protect buffalo and elephant herds.", "The Chelkou River flows through the reserve, nourishing the forests.", "The area acts as an ecological bridge between northern and southern Sudan.", "Illegal gold mining currently poses a significant threat to the ecosystem."],
