      en: ["The complex was established in 1946 as part of the Zande Scheme.", "It was once the primary industrial center in southern Sudan.", "The factories produced textiles, soap, and edible oils for the region.", "Nzara is located in the highly fertile Western Equatoria State.", "The site historically featured its own biomass power generation plant.", "Modern initiatives are working to restart the sugar production lines."],
