      en: ["Dry season cattle count: 150,000–200,000", "Grazing area: 50 km²", "Milk yield per cow/year: 400 l", "Calf mortality 2023: 18%", "Cattle price: 300–500 USD", "Brucellosis prevalence: 12%"],
