      en: ["The plantations are located about 50 km north of the capital city, Juba.", "The scheme was first conceptualized in the 1970s.", "The White Nile provides the essential water for irrigation.", "The region is characterized by highly fertile alluvial soils.", "The project aims to produce white industrial-grade sugar locally.", "Foreign investors have shown interest in reviving the sugar mill project."],
